{"title":"Boar","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 6 Boar that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boar\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boar?lv=3\">Lv 3 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/boar?lv=4\">Lv 4 <span>9</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boar?lv=5\">Lv 5 <span>20</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boar?lv=6\">Lv 6 <span>22</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/boar?lv=3\" title=\"Pick level 3\"><td><b>3</b></td><td>16</td><td>3.1</td><td>150</td><td class=\"muted\">48 · 4.3 · 450</td><td>5</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binx%20Crypt\">Binx Crypt</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/boar\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>4</b></td><td>18</td><td>4</td><td>200</td><td class=\"muted\">54 · 5.6 · 600</td><td>9</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/boar?lv=5\" title=\"Pick level 5\"><td><b>5</b></td><td>20</td><td>5.1</td><td>250</td><td class=\"muted\">60 · 7.1 · 750</td><td>20</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/boar?lv=6\" title=\"Pick level 6\"><td><b>6</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>22</td><td>6.2</td><td>300</td><td class=\"muted\">66 · 8.7 · 900</td><td>22</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"boar\" data-map-level=\"4\">Show level 4 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 1 recorded drop, 3 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 29 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Smoldering%20Den\">Smoldering Den</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 20 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 12 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binx%20Crypt\">Binx Crypt</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 11 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Imp%20Tree\">Imp Tree</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 10 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Rustpick%20Mine\">Rustpick Mine</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/King%20Jordon's%20Tomb\">King Jordon&#39;s Tomb</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Windthorne\">Windthorne</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"boar\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/d7731346cea2e7cf972b.webp\" alt=\"Boar\"></div><h3>Boar</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>4</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 6)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Boar</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>18</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>200</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.1 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>140 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}